{"ref":"BDB, גְּדֵרָה","hw":"גְּדֵרָה","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֵרָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֶ֫רֶת</span></big>  <strong>n.f. wall</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֵרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.23\">1 Ch 4:23</a> + <a data-ref=\"Psalms 62:4\" href=\"/Psalms.62.4\">ψ 62:4</a> (MT <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּדֵר</span> q.v.), <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֶרֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.5\">Ez 13:5</a> (Co, cf. 𝔊; MT <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּדֵר</span>) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.12\">42:12</a> (del. Co); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֵרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:17\" href=\"/Nahum.3.17\">Na 3:17</a> + 2 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֵרֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:24\" href=\"/Numbers.32.24\">Nu 32:24</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּדְרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:26\" href=\"/Numbers.32.26\">Nu 32:26</a> + 2 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּדְרֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:16\" href=\"/Numbers.32.16\">Nu 32:16</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֵרֹתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:41\" href=\"/Psalms.89.41\">ψ 89:41</a>;—<em>wall, hedge</em> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.23\">1 Ch 4:23</a> (or is this n.pr.loc.? cf. Öt) <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:17\" href=\"/Nahum.3.17\">Na 3:17</a> (where grasshoppers alight), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.3\">Je 49:3</a>; wall, connected with Ezekiel’s temple <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.12\">Ez 42:12</a> (del. Co); defences <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:41\" href=\"/Psalms.89.41\">ψ 89:41</a>; elsewhere <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳ צאן</span> <em>sheep-folds</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:16\" href=\"/Numbers.32.16\">Nu 32:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:36\" href=\"/Numbers.32.36\">36</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 24:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.24.4\">1 S 24:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:6\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.6\">Zp 2:6</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:24\" href=\"/Numbers.32.24\">Nu 32:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.5\">Ez 13:5</a> Co <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֶרֶת</span> after 𝔊; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 62:4\" href=\"/Psalms.62.4\">ψ 62:4</a> MT <span dir=\"rtl\">גדר הדחויה</span>, read <span dir=\"rtl\">גדרה ד׳</span> cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, גָּדֵר\" href=\"/BDB,_גָּדֵר\", dir=\"rtl\">גָּדֵר</a>.","next":"BDB, גְּדֵרָתִי","prev":"BDB, גֶּ֫דֶר"}